## The Hearing Room

@chair: The inspector further finds that the seaward rail was reported unsafe by the keeper himself, on the thirtieth of August.
@chair: And he has put before us a letter on this Board's own paper, refusing the money to mend it.
@chair: The Board will consider its own conduct in private session.
